# Supabase PostgreSQL Connection URL
# You can copy this directly from Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings -> Database -> Connection String (URI / Pooler)
# Format: postgresql://postgres.[PROJECT_REF]:[PASSWORD]@aws-0-eu-central-1.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres
